<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sadia Concordia cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sadia Concordia cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- DM Grenfell analyst Dana Voelzke has cut the rating for Brazilian meat processor Sadia Concordia SA Industria e Commercio SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our hold recommendation is based on our belief that Sadia should trade at a 15 percent discount to Perdigao (SA Comercio e Industria ) due to lower profitability levels,&quot; Voelzke wrote in an April 7 report.</p>
<p>-- Preferred shares in the company were up 0.05 real to 0.88 real in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
